# Code owners.
#
# GitHub requires the last matching pattern to win, so order matters:
# most-specific rules go last.
#
# For "Require review from Code Owners" to actually block a merge, enable
# it in Settings -> Branches -> branch protection for `main`. See
# contracts/README.md.

